        "book": "Zechariah",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And I will feed the flock of slaughter, even you, O poor of the flock. And I took unto me two staves; the one I called Beauty, and the other I called Bands; and I fed the flock.",
